WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.260 --> 01:38.940
=Episode 19=

01:39.860 --> 01:40.420
Father!

01:41.060 --> 01:42.100
It hurts so much...

01:42.260 --> 01:42.700
Enough!

01:44.020 --> 01:44.540
Drop the act.

01:45.780 --> 01:47.340
When have you ever planned things

01:47.580 --> 01:48.740
so carefully before?

01:49.260 --> 01:50.220
Did someone put you up to this?

01:54.860 --> 01:56.620
(Father rarely praises me.)

01:57.820 --> 01:58.180
Father,

01:59.540 --> 02:00.780
I'm a grown man now.

02:01.700 --> 02:02.660
I can handle

02:03.100 --> 02:04.140
a little thing like this.

02:09.340 --> 02:09.740
Well...

02:10.620 --> 02:12.060
You're nothing but trouble for me.

02:13.980 --> 02:14.780
You scared me to death.

02:16.220 --> 02:16.660
Ouch!

02:19.860 --> 02:20.260
By the way,

02:21.300 --> 02:24.980
that assessor, Yang Si, from the Court
of Judicial Review...

02:25.740 --> 02:27.420
Did you know him before?

02:28.540 --> 02:30.180
Why would I know him?

02:30.540 --> 02:31.740
He's a nobody.

02:33.500 --> 02:34.420
Listen to that arrogance.

02:35.500 --> 02:37.380
Actually, seeing you act like a fool

02:38.060 --> 02:38.740
puts my mind at ease.

02:41.900 --> 02:42.620
Focus on recovering.

02:42.860 --> 02:43.940
And stop running around.

02:44.580 --> 02:46.780
You really gave me a scare this time.

02:48.700 --> 02:49.140
Tomorrow...

02:49.460 --> 02:51.180
Tomorrow, I'll assign you

02:52.020 --> 02:53.380
some of my finest personal guards.

02:54.260 --> 02:55.980
They'll keep you safe
whenever you go out.

02:57.380 --> 02:58.620
Thank you, Father! Thank you!

02:58.980 --> 02:59.460
Shut up.

03:24.460 --> 03:24.860
Your Highness.

03:25.980 --> 03:26.940
How's Liu Wenji?

03:28.140 --> 03:28.860
He just fell asleep.

03:29.700 --> 03:30.260
Lately,

03:31.420 --> 03:32.860
he's finally been sleeping
a little better.

03:34.940 --> 03:35.940
He was having nightmares every night.

03:36.580 --> 03:37.460
It was heartbreaking to hear.

03:39.620 --> 03:40.420
Back then,

03:41.540 --> 03:42.940
Chunhua would cry herself to sleep

03:43.380 --> 03:44.260
and wake up crying.

03:47.620 --> 03:49.020
Zhang Jun brought this upon himself.

03:49.700 --> 03:50.780
He got exactly what he deserved.

03:54.820 --> 03:56.540
Both men rely on powerful backers.

03:57.260 --> 04:00.580
It all comes down to whose backer
is more ruthless.

04:01.580 --> 04:04.020
If Zhang Jun had even
a shred of decency,

04:04.900 --> 04:06.220
he wouldn't try to silence Yu Xianyao

04:07.180 --> 04:08.780
and provoke the man backing him.

04:14.100 --> 04:14.820
But Yan Shang,

04:15.900 --> 04:16.740
how could you be so sure

04:16.940 --> 04:18.500
that every move

04:18.780 --> 04:20.060
would fall into place as you want?

04:22.780 --> 04:23.580
You give me too much credit,
Your Highness.

04:23.980 --> 04:24.820
I'm no prophet.

04:25.100 --> 04:26.100
How could I predict everything?

04:26.820 --> 04:28.460
I was just trying my luck.

04:29.180 --> 04:29.820
If it didn't work this time,

04:29.940 --> 04:30.620
I'd try again.

04:31.220 --> 04:31.940
And if that failed,

04:32.540 --> 04:33.660
I'd keep trying until I succeeded.

04:34.980 --> 04:36.180
As long as Zhang Jun was alive,

04:36.820 --> 04:38.980
I'd make him pay for what he did.

04:41.500 --> 04:42.860
What a ruthless collator.

04:57.740 --> 04:58.420
(Slowly. Take it easy.)

04:59.340 --> 05:00.260
(Be extra careful these days.)

05:00.260 --> 05:02.300
(Sumai Shop)

05:02.700 --> 05:03.100
Wenji.

05:04.220 --> 05:04.580
Look.

05:11.900 --> 05:13.820
That's Zhang Cheng,
the Minister of Revenue.

05:19.060 --> 05:20.900
He was dismissed from office
a few days ago.

05:21.820 --> 05:23.300
(Sumai Shop)
Now he's heading home with a coffin.

05:23.820 --> 05:24.380
So...

05:27.220 --> 05:28.620
Even an arrogant, spoiled brat like him

05:30.900 --> 05:32.660
is helpless against someone
more powerful.

05:34.820 --> 05:36.780
Just like livestock,

05:37.700 --> 05:39.300
he's at their mercy.

05:44.820 --> 05:46.380
So this is how Sheng'an works?

06:06.700 --> 06:07.100
Shang.

06:10.500 --> 06:11.740
I want to see the Princess.

06:26.420 --> 06:27.180
Don't thank me.

06:28.100 --> 06:28.780
I only helped you

06:29.140 --> 06:30.380
because of Chunhua.

06:45.580 --> 06:46.300
Your Highness, I can never

06:47.180 --> 06:48.420
repay what you've done for me.

06:49.340 --> 06:49.900
But...

06:52.140 --> 06:53.940
I have one more favor to ask.

06:55.260 --> 06:55.980
Go on.

06:56.980 --> 06:57.580
I'll see what I can do.

06:59.460 --> 07:00.380
I'm not asking

07:00.940 --> 07:02.060
for money or jewels.

07:03.100 --> 07:04.780
I beg you to send me to the palace

07:05.620 --> 07:06.900
to serve as a palace eunuch.

07:09.180 --> 07:09.540
Wenji!

07:10.260 --> 07:10.980
Have you lost your mind?

07:14.900 --> 07:15.740
You want to enter the palace?

07:20.220 --> 07:21.180
That palace

07:21.620 --> 07:23.220
will swallow you alive.

07:23.820 --> 07:26.100
Even royals die there.
Countless of them.

07:26.940 --> 07:27.820
Palace maids and eunuchs?

07:28.580 --> 07:30.140
They're treated like dirt.

07:35.060 --> 07:36.540
Just look at what happened to Chunhua.

07:36.660 --> 07:37.060
I know.

07:40.460 --> 07:41.740
Chunhua and I...

07:43.500 --> 07:44.980
In the palace or out,

07:46.860 --> 07:48.020
we're both disposable.

07:50.260 --> 07:50.860
After all this,

07:51.500 --> 07:52.300
with both your help,

07:52.300 --> 07:53.500
I've finally figured it out.

07:55.660 --> 07:56.460
Zhang Jun wasn't the only one

07:57.220 --> 07:58.140
who destroyed my life.

07:59.340 --> 08:00.300
And what happened to Chunhua

08:00.860 --> 08:02.980
wasn't just the Prince of Jin
and Lord Yu's doing.

08:04.540 --> 08:06.860
In Sheng'an, power chews people up
and spits them out.

08:12.140 --> 08:12.460
Shang,

08:13.860 --> 08:14.580
even you

08:15.580 --> 08:16.900
have far more power than I do.

08:18.940 --> 08:20.100
You can help me get revenge

08:21.620 --> 08:22.740
and decide what happens to me.

08:26.740 --> 08:28.060
And Chunhua marrying
the Prince of Jin...

08:33.100 --> 08:34.860
You decided her fate too,
didn't you, Your Highness?

08:51.100 --> 08:51.420
Shang,

08:53.420 --> 08:54.740
I can't live like this anymore.

08:55.660 --> 08:57.300
Powerless, at everyone else's mercy.

09:00.620 --> 09:01.220
But...

09:05.060 --> 09:05.500
Yan Shang,

09:07.980 --> 09:09.820
you came to Sheng'an with nothing too.

09:12.500 --> 09:13.420
Do you really think

09:14.820 --> 09:16.340
I can't do what you did?

09:20.700 --> 09:21.220
Is that it?

09:24.420 --> 09:25.060
Wenji,

09:27.060 --> 09:28.300
I've never underestimated you.

09:32.500 --> 09:33.660
Well said, Liu Wenji.

09:34.820 --> 09:35.860
I didn't want to help you,

09:37.060 --> 09:37.980
but I've

09:38.380 --> 09:39.220
changed my mind.

09:41.580 --> 09:42.780
After all you've been through,

09:43.140 --> 09:44.100
what's left to be afraid of?

09:46.620 --> 09:47.940
When life knocks you into the dirt,

09:48.740 --> 09:50.380
no one's going to pull you out.

09:51.020 --> 09:51.700
You get yourself up

09:52.300 --> 09:52.940
and keep going.

09:54.340 --> 09:54.980
Liu Wenji,

09:55.860 --> 09:56.780
once you're in the palace,

09:57.300 --> 09:58.100
stay alive.

09:58.900 --> 10:00.140
Don't make me lose respect for you.

10:27.620 --> 10:28.860
I'm dying of thirst!

10:39.220 --> 10:40.180
How's Yu Xianyao doing?

10:40.540 --> 10:41.420
He's fine, of course.

10:41.900 --> 10:43.020
He's probably running around already.

10:43.700 --> 10:44.660
One little stab in the butt,

10:44.900 --> 10:46.180
and the whole Zhang family goes down.

10:47.340 --> 10:48.380
Zhang Cheng's nearly seventy.

10:48.900 --> 10:49.740
His hair's gone completely white.

10:51.020 --> 10:52.140
Now he's taking a coffin back home.

10:53.700 --> 10:54.380
It's just...

10:56.100 --> 10:57.140
The apple doesn't fall far
from the tree.

10:57.340 --> 10:58.340
Look at the son he raised.

10:58.860 --> 11:00.180
Maybe he looks pitiful next to Lord Yu,

11:01.060 --> 11:02.980
but how many lives has he thrown away
over the years?

11:03.500 --> 11:04.940
Who's going to feel sorry
for his victims?

11:10.500 --> 11:11.380
About what happened...

11:13.700 --> 11:14.380
Do you regret it?

11:15.580 --> 11:16.620
You mean, saving Yu Xianyao?

11:21.060 --> 11:21.900
I serve at the Court of Judicial Review.

11:22.820 --> 11:23.660
I couldn't just let him die.

11:24.740 --> 11:25.780
Yu Xianyao may be
an idle good-for-nothing.

11:26.220 --> 11:27.300
His misfortune was an act of fate.

11:27.900 --> 11:28.700
Saving him was my moral duty.

11:30.020 --> 11:31.020
Zhang Jun has committed
countless wrongs.

11:31.540 --> 11:32.900
This time, he crossed the wrong person.

11:33.620 --> 11:34.660
He brought this disaster on himself.

11:36.900 --> 11:38.020
Weigh each case with care,

11:38.460 --> 11:39.300
and follow what is just.

11:39.980 --> 11:40.940
Just what I'd expect from you.

11:43.180 --> 11:43.620
What about you?

11:45.580 --> 11:46.540
You dared to provoke a tiger.

11:47.460 --> 11:48.460
Weren't you afraid of getting caught
up in it?

11:51.100 --> 11:52.020
What's that got to do with me?

11:54.660 --> 11:56.220
Wanyao, let's not play games.

11:57.340 --> 11:58.820
You have no grudge against Zhang Cheng
or his son.

11:59.100 --> 11:59.980
Why get involved?

12:00.940 --> 12:02.020
I don't know what you're talking about.

12:02.740 --> 12:03.460
All I know is

12:04.660 --> 12:07.260
Yu Xianyao and Zhang Jun
both got what they deserved.

12:07.980 --> 12:08.420
And another thing.

12:09.180 --> 12:10.700
This is the second time
you've interrogated me.

12:11.980 --> 12:13.260
Why do you keep taking these risks?

12:13.780 --> 12:14.820
Then let me ask you something.

12:15.660 --> 12:16.980
The night before the exam results
came out,

12:17.340 --> 12:18.300
you went to Cuiyun Tower,

12:19.060 --> 12:21.300
and met military men who'd
entered the capital in disguise.

12:22.620 --> 12:23.780
Who were you risking your life for?

12:27.940 --> 12:28.780
Looks like I was right.

12:30.900 --> 12:32.580
Wanyao, this is a very serious matter.

12:32.580 --> 12:34.740
So you won't tell me the truth either.

12:35.660 --> 12:36.020
Am I right?

12:41.980 --> 12:42.380
Come on.

12:42.900 --> 12:43.500
I want to see the Crown Prince.

12:47.900 --> 12:49.460
(Chongli Hall)

12:49.460 --> 12:50.700
I've come here today to ask

12:51.100 --> 12:51.780
why you are

12:52.900 --> 12:54.340
meeting with frontier generals.

13:01.380 --> 13:02.940
You needn't worry about me, Wanyao.

13:03.660 --> 13:04.820
I don't know

13:05.060 --> 13:05.620
what they're up to in Sheng'an.

13:07.540 --> 13:09.260
Yang Si served in the army.

13:10.020 --> 13:10.780
He got along well with them

13:11.420 --> 13:12.900
and couldn't refuse their invitation
to meet.

13:13.700 --> 13:14.940
Even Yintaimen didn't find out.

13:15.660 --> 13:16.220
That's all there is to it.

13:16.860 --> 13:17.420
And there

13:18.380 --> 13:19.180
won't be any more meetings.

13:21.220 --> 13:22.860
You mean to win over military commanders

13:23.220 --> 13:24.500
and unite the frontier garrisons

13:25.380 --> 13:26.260
so that one day

13:26.820 --> 13:28.660
you can rival Yu Cheng'an's Shence Army.

13:32.660 --> 13:33.100
Am I right?

13:38.740 --> 13:39.140
Your Highness,

13:39.700 --> 13:40.820
Wanyao has always been rather outspoken.

13:48.340 --> 13:48.860
Wanyao.

13:51.300 --> 13:52.620
Why have you come here

13:53.260 --> 13:54.220
to tell me all this?

13:56.620 --> 13:58.020
If I were afraid for my life,

13:58.820 --> 13:59.900
I could simply pretend I knew nothing.

14:01.340 --> 14:02.700
If I wanted to betray you,

14:03.380 --> 14:04.660
I'd have told Yintaimen long ago.

14:05.540 --> 14:07.380
I know you've always
underestimated women.

14:08.180 --> 14:10.580
But women can operate in secret

14:11.100 --> 14:12.060
without raising suspicion.

14:17.180 --> 14:18.180
I'm willing to help you

14:19.060 --> 14:20.180
reach the frontier armies

14:20.780 --> 14:21.740
in different provinces,

14:22.100 --> 14:22.980
even meet them secretly in disguise.

14:23.980 --> 14:25.180
After all, everyone knows

14:25.500 --> 14:26.820
how willful and reckless I am.

14:27.220 --> 14:29.060
Sending letters demanding gifts
from the provinces

14:29.540 --> 14:30.860
would be perfectly in character for me.

14:31.940 --> 14:33.220
And with my scandalous reputation,

14:33.740 --> 14:34.940
frequenting pleasure houses

14:35.340 --> 14:37.140
and drinking all night
wouldn't seem unusual.

14:37.540 --> 14:38.980
Wanyao, it's too dangerous!

14:40.020 --> 14:41.300
If you dare to go this far,

14:42.500 --> 14:43.780
why not trust me for once?

14:53.820 --> 14:54.500
All right.

14:58.420 --> 15:03.020
(Cuiyun Tower)

15:07.700 --> 15:12.400
♪A rough-cut gem, held close to heart;
Lean bamboo bones, yet mountain-bold♪

15:12.400 --> 15:17.060
♪A rough-cut gem, held close to heart;
Lean bamboo bones, yet mountain-bold♪

15:17.260 --> 15:21.580
♪Books bear no blade; Yet tens of
thousands of scrolls can pierce the sky♪

15:21.580 --> 15:26.300
♪Books bear no blade; Yet tens of
thousands of scrolls can pierce the sky♪

15:27.380 --> 15:31.660
♪My body is the furnace,
flames reach the clouds♪

15:31.780 --> 15:36.820
♪Winds gather, then drift apart♪

15:37.180 --> 15:39.140
♪I see no court, only a boundless world♪

15:39.140 --> 15:39.540
Mr. Wang.

15:39.980 --> 15:40.260
Over here!

15:41.740 --> 15:42.060
Coming!

15:44.500 --> 15:45.700
Someone close the window, please!

15:46.500 --> 15:51.100
♪I gaze at high peaks
and sails far away♪

15:51.460 --> 15:55.540
♪With the world in my heart,
I leave the shore♪

15:55.700 --> 16:00.300
♪With rain ahead, I cross the pass♪

16:01.060 --> 16:05.140
♪Who'll wait with me for the boat home?♪

16:05.700 --> 16:10.460
♪By noon, the mist will lift;
rivers will bend♪

16:10.780 --> 16:14.420
♪I'll take the open road
and journey home♪

16:15.140 --> 16:19.940
♪With rosy clouds,
I bid the moon goodnight♪

16:20.620 --> 16:24.260
♪And trade my old robes for new♪

16:33.420 --> 16:34.540
Let's go. He'll only get on your nerves.

17:37.860 --> 17:41.860
♪The midsummer breeze
blows soft and sweet♪

17:41.860 --> 17:46.300
♪Fireflies dance freely
through the night♪

17:46.420 --> 17:50.440
♪Chasing the beauty
of this fleeting world♪

17:50.440 --> 17:54.620
♪A thousand lights turn night into day♪

17:54.700 --> 17:58.860
♪Cicada songs mingle with the wine♪

17:58.860 --> 18:03.140
♪Their songs linger
through the passing years♪

18:03.420 --> 18:07.080
♪Life is but a fleeting stay; How lucky
I am to walk this path with you♪

18:07.080 --> 18:11.220
♪Life is but a fleeting stay; How lucky
I am to walk this path with you♪

18:12.020 --> 18:15.860
♪Playing out life's game,
forever by your side♪

18:15.860 --> 18:20.180
♪Innocent years drift gently by♪

18:20.580 --> 18:24.040
♪I thought time might stand still;
Forever at that crossroads♪

18:24.040 --> 18:28.020
♪I thought time might stand still;
Forever at that crossroads♪

18:29.140 --> 18:33.060
♪Watching flowers bloom and fade;
Weathering life's rise and fall♪

18:33.060 --> 18:36.900
♪Watching flowers bloom and fade;
Weathering life's rise and fall♪

18:37.540 --> 18:41.500
♪Turns out, unspoken tenderness;
Is starlight caught in your eyes♪

18:41.500 --> 18:45.660
♪Turns out, unspoken tenderness;
Is starlight caught in your eyes♪

19:03.940 --> 19:05.340
That's what you get for sneaking food!

19:06.020 --> 19:06.940
Have you no shame?

19:07.180 --> 19:09.100
You're a disgrace to us palace eunuchs!

19:10.660 --> 19:11.420
What are you looking at?

19:13.580 --> 19:14.980
What are you waiting for?

19:15.460 --> 19:16.060
Get back to work!

19:18.340 --> 19:19.340
What have I always taught you?

19:19.780 --> 19:20.780
Are you trying to make me angry?

19:22.220 --> 19:22.740
Hurry up!

19:23.180 --> 19:23.460
Scrub!

19:23.780 --> 19:24.140
Keep scrubbing!

19:25.900 --> 19:26.740
I'll deal with you when we get back!

19:28.980 --> 19:30.260
Sneaking food, of all things!

19:52.580 --> 19:52.980
Sir.

19:54.700 --> 19:55.660
Greetings, sir.

19:56.460 --> 19:57.980
We're short-handed at Hongwen Hall.

19:58.820 --> 20:00.180
Could you spare two men for a few days?

20:01.540 --> 20:04.300
You're asking me to lend you some men?

20:04.540 --> 20:04.900
Yes.

20:05.740 --> 20:06.820
We're swamped with paperwork
for the holidays.

20:07.060 --> 20:08.780
Even working from dawn till dark,
we can't finish copying it all.

20:09.420 --> 20:10.700
You have so many eunuchs
at the Imperial Cuisine Service.

20:11.380 --> 20:12.140
All they do is deliver meals.

20:12.420 --> 20:13.340
They've got time to spare.

20:13.860 --> 20:14.260
Why not

20:14.740 --> 20:15.420
let them give us a hand?

20:16.420 --> 20:18.180
Please don't tease me, sir.

20:18.820 --> 20:20.460
Servants like us

20:20.580 --> 20:22.580
can barely read a word.

20:22.700 --> 20:24.500
How could we possibly do that?

20:25.220 --> 20:26.260
Even if we could read,

20:26.740 --> 20:28.300
messy handwriting wouldn't do.

20:29.460 --> 20:30.060
Yan Shang,

20:30.420 --> 20:31.420
you must be joking.

20:32.140 --> 20:32.660
See?

20:33.260 --> 20:33.660
Right?

20:35.420 --> 20:36.660
Would any of you like to help?

20:39.820 --> 20:40.540
You see, sir?

20:40.780 --> 20:41.380
None of them...

20:41.380 --> 20:41.820
I...

20:48.220 --> 20:48.780
I'd like to help.

20:49.460 --> 20:50.260
Don't talk nonsense!

20:50.580 --> 20:51.820
He's only been here six months.

20:52.260 --> 20:54.500
He's still learning his duties here.

20:55.020 --> 20:56.820
King Wen wrote the Book of Changes
in captivity.

20:57.980 --> 20:59.980
Confucius wrote the Spring
and Autumn Annals in adversity.

21:02.060 --> 21:02.860
Can you write that down?

21:29.980 --> 21:32.300
(King Wen wrote the Book of Changes
in captivity.)

21:35.300 --> 21:35.772
(King Wen wrote the Book of Changes
in captivity.)

21:35.773 --> 21:36.340
(Confucius wrote the Spring
and Autumn Annals in adversity.)

21:36.340 --> 21:36.660
Well...

21:37.140 --> 21:38.700
That's actually quite impressive!

21:40.580 --> 21:42.260
You've got real talent hiding here.

21:42.700 --> 21:43.420
No, no, not at all.

21:46.380 --> 21:46.820
Good work.

21:47.500 --> 21:48.140
Come help us out.

21:53.060 --> 21:53.740
Liu Wenji.

21:54.500 --> 21:55.500
You...

21:57.980 --> 21:59.660
You'd better do a good job.

22:02.340 --> 22:02.700
Thank you.

22:06.260 --> 22:06.780
Let's go, Yan Shang.

23:26.500 --> 23:26.740
Here.

23:27.300 --> 23:27.820
Have some water.

23:28.580 --> 23:30.180
You won't have a moment to spare later.

23:36.860 --> 23:37.140
Oh, don't!

23:38.100 --> 23:39.340
I'm used to doing this
at the local school.

24:06.980 --> 24:08.060
I spent ages thinking
about it yesterday,

24:08.060 --> 24:09.540
but I still couldn't figure it out.

24:10.060 --> 24:10.900
So today, I'm going to

24:10.900 --> 24:12.220
give it another thorough look.

24:12.620 --> 24:13.140
All right.

24:14.660 --> 24:15.140
Yan Shang?

24:16.980 --> 24:17.420
Cui Ren.

24:18.060 --> 24:18.540
Come take a look.

24:24.140 --> 24:26.460
(Liao rises west of Pingchun.
Its northern source is Mt. Dayi.)

24:26.860 --> 24:27.140
This...

24:28.420 --> 24:29.180
This is excellent.

24:29.740 --> 24:29.980
Here.

24:30.660 --> 24:31.140
Take a look.

24:31.500 --> 24:32.140
Beautiful calligraphy.

24:32.660 --> 24:33.540
Look at those powerful strokes!

24:34.980 --> 24:36.340
Did this young eunuch copy it?

24:37.180 --> 24:38.780
(Liao rises west of Pingchun.)
How many years to forge such strokes?

24:39.300 --> 24:40.740
There's such vigor in every character.

24:40.740 --> 24:41.940
Look at how the strokes flow.

24:42.500 --> 24:44.500
It's seamless from beginning to end!

24:45.820 --> 24:48.180
At last, we've got someone to help
with all this copying.

24:48.860 --> 24:49.500
Just look at this.

24:50.380 --> 24:51.620
Well, all right, everyone.

24:52.460 --> 24:53.260
It's getting late.

24:53.700 --> 24:55.300
We should get back
to collating the texts.

24:55.940 --> 24:56.180
Right.

25:44.900 --> 25:45.580
Greetings, Your Highness.

25:47.500 --> 25:48.140
Wei Shu?

25:50.180 --> 25:51.300
What brings you here?

25:51.700 --> 25:53.180
The Censorate has granted us seven days
off for the New Year's Day.

25:53.620 --> 25:54.460
I'm planning to visit my hometown.

25:55.140 --> 25:56.300
I came to say goodbye.

25:56.900 --> 25:57.300
Very good.

25:57.780 --> 25:58.900
At least you remembered to tell me.

26:01.060 --> 26:01.460
Come with me.

26:14.660 --> 26:17.500
(Dong'e Ejiao)

26:17.500 --> 26:18.140
I got these for you.

26:19.100 --> 26:19.580
(Dong'e Ejiao)
Take them all.

26:21.100 --> 26:21.500
Your Highness,

26:21.900 --> 26:22.300
I can't accept these!

26:24.140 --> 26:25.260
Returning home in glory

26:25.660 --> 26:26.460
has always been a cherished tradition.

26:26.980 --> 26:27.580
(Dong'e Ejiao)
Besides,

26:27.900 --> 26:28.980
you work for me now.

26:29.420 --> 26:31.980
You wouldn't want to embarrass me
when you go home, would you?

26:32.820 --> 26:33.100
But...

26:36.540 --> 26:38.940
(Dong'e Ejiao)

26:40.980 --> 26:41.580
Thank you, Your Highness.

26:43.180 --> 26:45.580
No wonder he's so educated. Even his
name has "Wen", as in "culture"!

26:46.020 --> 26:47.460
He's got a head full of knowledge.

26:48.740 --> 26:49.580
Jealous?

26:50.060 --> 26:51.180
You could ask Godfather

26:51.820 --> 26:53.780
to give you a better name.

26:55.060 --> 26:55.940
Like what?

26:57.140 --> 26:59.140
Adding "Hua" to mine and "Xi" to yours?

26:59.180 --> 27:01.340
So it's like, I'll be Chen Lianhua
and you'll be Wang Xiqing?

27:01.580 --> 27:02.540
Those aren't bad!

27:02.540 --> 27:03.700
Listen to yourself!

27:06.020 --> 27:06.820
At first,

27:07.380 --> 27:09.300
all he did was run errands
and do odd jobs.

27:09.620 --> 27:10.460
Everyone looked down on him.

27:11.860 --> 27:13.620
But then, somehow,

27:15.260 --> 27:16.780
everyone started treating him better.

27:16.940 --> 27:19.420
Well, he does have
beautiful handwriting!

27:19.740 --> 27:20.580
You have no idea.

27:20.580 --> 27:21.340
Can you believe that?

27:21.540 --> 27:23.020
Speak up! What happened next?

27:26.340 --> 27:26.900
Lord Yu!

27:28.140 --> 27:29.300
What happened next?

27:30.380 --> 27:32.020
- I wouldn't dare, my lord!
- We wouldn't dare!

27:32.180 --> 27:33.580
What's there to be afraid of?

27:34.540 --> 27:35.620
I have some time to spare today.

27:36.500 --> 27:36.940
Go on.

27:37.380 --> 27:39.460
Let's hear something
I don't already know.

27:40.140 --> 27:42.820
We'd never dare gossip about affairs
in your residence.

27:43.100 --> 27:44.900
We were talking
about the Imperial Cuisine Service.

27:45.900 --> 27:47.300
I don't care where it happened.

27:47.420 --> 27:47.820
Tell me.

27:48.780 --> 27:49.220
Get up and speak.

27:53.700 --> 27:54.220
Well, Lord Yu,

27:54.580 --> 27:56.860
a new eunuch joined
the Imperial Cuisine Service recently.

27:57.100 --> 27:58.500
- That's right.
- Not only can he read and write,

27:58.860 --> 28:00.420
but his calligraphy is exceptional.

28:00.860 --> 28:02.220
He caught the attention of Hongwen Hall.

28:02.460 --> 28:03.780
They took him off his usual duties

28:03.980 --> 28:06.220
and put him to work copying manuscripts.

28:11.540 --> 28:12.860
What's his name?

28:13.180 --> 28:13.740
My lord,

28:14.220 --> 28:16.580
his name is Liu Wenji.

28:16.940 --> 28:18.260
Yes, Liu Wenji.

28:19.660 --> 28:22.340
(Lunar New Year's Eve)

28:23.700 --> 28:24.285
(Shentu)

28:24.286 --> 28:27.580
May Huai prosper and its people
live in peace.

28:30.060 --> 28:31.060
(Yulei)
May sacred wood ward off all misfortune,

28:31.580 --> 28:32.660
(Shentu and Yulei)
and blessings fill our home.

28:34.340 --> 28:35.700
May you enjoy good health
in the new year, Father.

28:35.820 --> 28:36.340
(Shentu; Yulei)

28:36.340 --> 28:36.620
Good.

28:51.900 --> 28:52.780
I wonder

28:53.660 --> 28:55.460
how much longer this aging body of mine

28:56.580 --> 28:58.380
can keep protecting you all.

28:59.220 --> 28:59.900
Father!

29:00.140 --> 29:01.500
Don't talk like that on New Year's!

29:12.940 --> 29:13.860
When you were little,

29:14.020 --> 29:16.140
your hands were so soft and chubby.

29:17.060 --> 29:20.140
Holding one felt like holding
a little dumpling.

29:22.580 --> 29:24.060
Back then, my hands

29:25.980 --> 29:27.700
weren't so dry and wrinkled either.

29:29.300 --> 29:30.540
Where does

29:31.820 --> 29:32.620
all the time

29:33.780 --> 29:35.340
go?

29:42.980 --> 29:43.580
I remember

29:44.900 --> 29:46.340
one New Year's Day,

29:47.500 --> 29:49.980
I was hosting a banquet at Hanyuan Hall.

29:50.500 --> 29:51.940
You suddenly came running in.

29:52.380 --> 29:52.860
You were

29:54.220 --> 29:55.620
only about this tall.

29:56.900 --> 29:57.500
You were

29:58.180 --> 29:59.180
wobbling as you ran,

30:00.740 --> 30:02.180
demanding a taste of wine.

30:03.860 --> 30:04.300
So,

30:04.860 --> 30:06.940
your mother took a chopstick,

30:06.940 --> 30:08.420
dipped it in just a little wine,

30:08.700 --> 30:09.620
and let you lick it.

30:11.380 --> 30:12.380
You were so little.

30:12.380 --> 30:13.300
You wouldn't remember.

30:14.140 --> 30:14.940
I do remember.

30:15.260 --> 30:16.100
The wine burned my tongue.

30:16.940 --> 30:18.260
How could you remember?

30:18.260 --> 30:19.100
You were so young.

30:21.020 --> 30:21.980
I also remember

30:23.380 --> 30:26.060
Mother wore a green silk shawl that day.

30:26.540 --> 30:28.500
It had beautiful little flowers
embroidered on it.

30:29.540 --> 30:30.620
I remember thinking,

30:31.260 --> 30:32.140
"When I grow up,

30:33.020 --> 30:33.980
I want to dress just like her."

30:37.420 --> 30:37.820
Yes...

30:40.420 --> 30:41.620
That's exactly

30:43.740 --> 30:44.860
how your mother looked that day.

30:49.260 --> 30:51.100
I can still picture her.

30:53.780 --> 30:55.580
As if it were only yesterday.

31:00.380 --> 31:01.820
Life is but a dream,

31:02.500 --> 31:03.220
a fleeting stay,

31:04.700 --> 31:05.940
a journey through a strange land.

31:06.980 --> 31:07.500
Father,

31:08.340 --> 31:09.740
it's "Life is but a fleeting stay.

31:09.900 --> 31:10.900
We should enjoy it while we can.

31:12.020 --> 31:12.900
Why waste it on sorrow?"

31:13.660 --> 31:14.420
You got the verse wrong.

31:18.780 --> 31:19.740
I remembered it wrong.

31:29.020 --> 31:29.540
(Father...)

31:31.580 --> 31:32.260
(Wait for me.)

31:34.540 --> 31:35.820
(Please, hold on until then.)

32:06.500 --> 32:11.820
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

32:11.900 --> 32:18.580
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- Let grief drown in your eyes♪

32:20.060 --> 32:23.038
♪Soar with the wind,
burning bright as a song♪

32:23.039 --> 32:24.900
♪Plunge into hellfire as one♪

32:24.980 --> 32:28.540
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

32:28.700 --> 32:33.620
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

32:33.940 --> 32:38.620
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

32:38.740 --> 32:40.580
♪Not a single hour less♪

32:40.660 --> 32:44.420
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

32:44.420 --> 32:48.300
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

32:48.380 --> 32:51.820
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

32:52.020 --> 32:55.380
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

32:55.660 --> 33:02.500
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

33:02.740 --> 33:04.620
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

33:04.620 --> 33:07.260
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn;
- May time be free of pain♪

33:07.300 --> 33:09.860
♪You're the only one I need♪

33:09.900 --> 33:13.440
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

33:13.440 --> 33:17.060
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

33:17.140 --> 33:20.500
♪- Be my one and only in this world;
- Be my one and only in this life♪

33:20.540 --> 33:23.980
♪My last untouched innocence♪

33:24.220 --> 33:27.660
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

33:27.900 --> 33:31.340
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

33:31.460 --> 33:38.380
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

33:38.540 --> 33:40.460
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

33:40.460 --> 33:43.060
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn;
- May time be free of pain♪

33:43.180 --> 33:45.700
♪You're the only one I need♪

33:45.780 --> 33:49.260
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

33:49.260 --> 33:52.940
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

33:52.980 --> 33:56.380
♪- Till fireworks flood the town;
- Till the lake is still and clear♪

33:56.460 --> 33:59.820
♪The wind blows past us♪

34:00.140 --> 34:04.860
♪- If there's still...
- Some warmth left in this world♪

34:05.500 --> 34:09.860
♪You're the only one I need♪

34:21.860 --> 34:22.780
Thank you, Xiaozhou.

34:23.460 --> 34:23.820
Father.

34:24.380 --> 34:25.980
I... I'd like to hear

34:27.140 --> 34:28.020
Shang's letter again.

34:28.780 --> 34:30.540
Brother, I can recite the whole thing!

34:31.340 --> 34:33.460
Shang says he's doing well in Sheng'an.

34:33.580 --> 34:34.500
He did really well on his exams.

34:35.180 --> 34:36.100
He placed third.

34:36.100 --> 34:37.140
And he got into Hongwen Hall.

34:37.500 --> 34:38.860
Princess Danyang treats him well, too.

34:39.060 --> 34:40.180
For Shang to have come this far,

34:41.220 --> 34:42.900
he must have faced so many dangers.

34:44.060 --> 34:46.300
Father, what do you mean?

35:18.500 --> 35:18.940
Your Highness.

35:20.540 --> 35:21.100
Are you all right?

35:44.300 --> 35:49.220
(Wei Residence, Jingzhao)

36:10.540 --> 36:15.660
(Cherish Kinship and Family Harmony)

36:18.420 --> 36:19.260
It's freezing out here.

36:19.700 --> 36:21.220
Why aren't you inside resting?

36:22.460 --> 36:22.860
Brother.

36:25.340 --> 36:26.780
I was looking at the old house.

36:27.540 --> 36:28.340
(Cherish Kinship and Family Harmony)
Compared to when I was little,

36:29.020 --> 36:30.060
it hardly seems to have changed.

36:31.300 --> 36:31.780
Yes.

36:32.740 --> 36:33.740
The house hasn't changed.

36:34.540 --> 36:35.580
Neither has the way

36:36.300 --> 36:37.060
people treat each other.

36:39.060 --> 36:39.860
As for how people treat me,

36:40.540 --> 36:41.620
I've been used to it since childhood.

36:42.820 --> 36:44.140
I don't let it bother me anymore.

36:49.140 --> 36:49.380
Sit.

36:57.980 --> 36:58.540
Shu,

36:59.380 --> 37:00.460
back then,

37:01.420 --> 37:02.220
I actually envied you.

37:02.860 --> 37:03.740
What was there to envy?

37:04.340 --> 37:05.660
You came from a lesser branch
of the family

37:05.860 --> 37:06.620
and were on your own.

37:07.660 --> 37:09.820
You had little money, but you could
come and go as you pleased.

37:10.940 --> 37:12.900
You didn't have to carry the weight
of our ancestors' legacy

37:13.420 --> 37:14.460
or the entire family's honor,

37:15.220 --> 37:17.140
constantly watching your every step.

37:19.180 --> 37:19.820
I know

37:20.340 --> 37:22.540
your talents go far beyond literature.

37:23.220 --> 37:23.700
Divination,

37:24.140 --> 37:24.620
alchemy,

37:25.180 --> 37:26.140
astronomy, engineering...

37:26.740 --> 37:28.220
Those are your true passions.

37:29.060 --> 37:30.980
Perhaps neither Sheng'an
nor the imperial court

37:32.580 --> 37:33.100
is somewhere

37:34.060 --> 37:35.700
you're meant to stay for long.

37:40.020 --> 37:41.020
The world is vast,

37:41.620 --> 37:43.020
yet there are so many places

37:43.940 --> 37:45.140
I can't go, or am not free to go.

37:46.420 --> 37:46.940
Shu,

37:48.460 --> 37:49.740
you have far more freedom than I do.

37:52.540 --> 37:53.060
Qiao...

37:59.780 --> 38:02.980
(Cherish Kinship and Family Harmony)

38:02.980 --> 38:04.060
This place brings back memories.

38:04.660 --> 38:06.220
I couldn't help rambling a little.

38:08.780 --> 38:09.980
Don't make fun of me.

38:12.020 --> 38:12.540
All right.

38:13.100 --> 38:14.300
Go inside and get some rest.

38:19.980 --> 38:20.340
Qiao.

38:29.580 --> 38:29.980
Qiao.

38:31.620 --> 38:32.780
Even the greatest power

38:33.620 --> 38:34.660
can melt away like ice and snow

38:35.100 --> 38:36.300
in the blink of an eye.

38:38.300 --> 38:39.100
The path you've chosen

38:39.940 --> 38:41.100
is extremely dangerous.

38:42.380 --> 38:43.180
Please think it over.

38:47.700 --> 38:48.940
You're a learned man.

38:49.900 --> 38:50.860
Surely you know

38:52.460 --> 38:53.780
that the Lord of the West

38:54.180 --> 38:56.500
was once merely
a vassal of the King of Shang.

38:57.460 --> 38:59.300
Yet history remembers

39:00.500 --> 39:02.020
the overthrow of the Shang tyrant

39:05.260 --> 39:06.860
as an act of Heaven's justice.

39:12.060 --> 39:12.540
Shu.

39:14.300 --> 39:15.500
You have your own path.

39:16.900 --> 39:17.380
And I

39:18.740 --> 39:19.780
have mine.

39:33.820 --> 39:37.860
(Peace and Safety)

39:41.780 --> 39:45.900
(Peace and Safety)

40:06.660 --> 40:07.100
Your Highness,

40:08.820 --> 40:09.820
are we really walking home?

40:10.380 --> 40:11.420
Your shoes will get wet.

40:13.780 --> 40:15.740
You've spent too long in Lingnan.

40:16.700 --> 40:18.380
The snow in Sheng'an
has only just settled.

40:18.900 --> 40:19.700
It's not going to melt yet.

40:20.420 --> 40:20.700
Come on!

40:22.100 --> 40:23.300
That's not the way home, Wanyao.

40:23.740 --> 40:24.980
Who said you knew where I was going?

40:25.340 --> 40:25.940
Aren't we going home?

40:26.300 --> 40:27.020
Nope.

40:27.500 --> 40:28.380
I want to show you somewhere.

40:31.060 --> 40:34.700
(Infirmary)

40:41.620 --> 40:45.060
(Infirmary)

40:47.780 --> 40:48.660
Sis's here!

40:48.660 --> 40:50.980
Sis! Sis! Sis!

40:51.540 --> 40:52.820
Sis's here!

40:54.700 --> 40:56.140
Sis! Sis! Sis!

40:56.140 --> 40:58.420
Happy New Year's Eve! Wishing you
a wonderful new year!

40:59.620 --> 41:00.500
Treats! Here you are.

41:00.660 --> 41:01.700
I want some!

41:01.700 --> 41:02.780
Don't fight over them.

41:02.780 --> 41:03.900
Can I have one?

41:04.220 --> 41:04.860
Give me one!

41:04.860 --> 41:05.940
This one's mine!

41:06.260 --> 41:06.900
This one's pretty!

41:06.900 --> 41:08.140
- Help me hand these out.
- This one's for you!

41:08.340 --> 41:08.820
Thank you!

41:08.820 --> 41:09.500
Pick whichever you like.

41:10.100 --> 41:11.660
Here, take your pick.

41:13.100 --> 41:14.300
Stop grabbing mine!

41:14.700 --> 41:15.300
Okay, you want this one?

41:16.140 --> 41:16.500
- Here you go.
- All right.

41:16.740 --> 41:17.140
Careful.

41:17.980 --> 41:18.860
Thank you, Sis!

41:18.860 --> 41:19.820
Can I have another?

41:19.820 --> 41:20.260
Thanks!

41:20.260 --> 41:21.260
Don't take mine!

41:21.580 --> 41:22.220
- There's food here!
- Here.

41:22.220 --> 41:22.900
- This is for you.
- Treats.

41:23.060 --> 41:23.540
This one's for you.

41:23.660 --> 41:24.980
I want to play with that too!

41:27.140 --> 41:27.900
You seem to know

41:28.100 --> 41:28.980
exactly what to buy.

41:30.660 --> 41:31.260
These were

41:31.460 --> 41:33.060
my favorite treats and toys growing up.

41:34.220 --> 41:34.980
Back then,

41:35.620 --> 41:37.460
my parents used to buy them for me
all the time.

41:38.380 --> 41:39.020
Now,

41:39.820 --> 41:40.940
whenever I want to see them again,

41:41.340 --> 41:42.340
I bring some for the children.

41:43.980 --> 41:45.340
Ever since I returned to Sheng'an,

41:45.700 --> 41:46.620
I've been coming here a lot.

41:46.900 --> 41:48.620
Sometimes I can't tell

41:49.180 --> 41:50.340
whether I'm comforting them,

41:51.100 --> 41:53.180
or they're the ones comforting me.

42:02.420 --> 42:03.300
Slow down!

42:07.500 --> 42:08.460
You can't catch me!

42:09.780 --> 42:10.620
Hey, come here!

42:10.620 --> 42:11.660
Careful. Don't burn yourself.

42:17.420 --> 42:18.180
Is the porridge ready?

42:18.820 --> 42:19.100
Yes.

42:19.100 --> 42:19.900
Coming!

42:24.660 --> 42:25.260
You too.

42:25.940 --> 42:27.620
Don't come crying if you burn yourself.

42:30.060 --> 42:30.460
Let me do it.

42:38.500 --> 42:38.940
That should do it.

42:50.700 --> 42:51.780
Come on, time to eat!

42:52.420 --> 42:53.380
We've got something yummy!

42:53.380 --> 42:54.060
Easy, easy!

42:54.740 --> 42:55.540
Careful, it's hot!

42:56.020 --> 42:57.740
No rush. There's enough for everyone.

42:57.940 --> 42:59.580
Smells so good!

43:05.140 --> 43:05.660
Give me some!

43:06.300 --> 43:07.380
It's so good!

43:08.260 --> 43:09.060
It's delicious!

43:09.260 --> 43:10.020
Here, try some!

43:10.180 --> 43:11.740
Don't eat mine!

43:14.300 --> 43:15.060
That's mine!

43:18.260 --> 43:19.140
This one's good too!

43:20.500 --> 43:21.580
Why aren't you eating?

43:24.020 --> 43:24.620
Aren't you hungry?

43:27.500 --> 43:28.300
My teeth fell out.

43:30.620 --> 43:31.980
Oh, you're losing your baby teeth.

43:37.820 --> 43:39.460
That means you're growing up.

43:40.140 --> 43:41.220
Once your new teeth come in,

43:42.220 --> 43:44.780
I'll bring you even
more delicious treats.

43:45.260 --> 43:45.660
How's that?

43:47.300 --> 43:47.940
Promise.

43:48.580 --> 43:49.020
Sis,

43:49.540 --> 43:51.460
I'm going to play over there now.

43:54.100 --> 43:54.700
Here, take this!

43:55.180 --> 43:56.220
Come on, try this!

43:57.060 --> 43:58.100
Sis, come quick!

43:58.940 --> 43:59.580
Look at this!

43:59.740 --> 44:00.700
I want more!

44:01.260 --> 44:02.660
Can I have another one?

44:02.860 --> 44:03.620
Are there any left?

44:06.260 --> 44:06.780
I didn't realize

44:07.540 --> 44:08.700
you liked children so much.

44:13.940 --> 44:14.740
I don't like children.

44:16.420 --> 44:16.900
Your Highness,

44:17.580 --> 44:18.460
but just now...

44:18.540 --> 44:19.100
Yan Shang!

44:19.300 --> 44:20.180
I don't like children!

44:20.500 --> 44:21.260
Do I make myself clear?

44:24.380 --> 44:29.100
(Next Episode Preview)

44:29.100 --> 44:31.900
Time for the Princess of Huai
to serve me in the bridal chamber.

44:47.481 --> 44:50.774
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

44:53.459 --> 44:58.375
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

45:00.569 --> 45:06.414
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

45:06.914 --> 45:12.140
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

45:14.909 --> 45:19.700
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

45:20.536 --> 45:26.615
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

45:28.416 --> 45:31.566
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

45:31.566 --> 45:33.214
♪Burning bright as a song♪

45:33.266 --> 45:36.990
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

45:37.368 --> 45:42.034
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

45:42.653 --> 45:46.694
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

45:47.185 --> 45:49.300
♪Not a single hour less♪

45:49.340 --> 45:56.286
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

45:57.049 --> 46:00.502
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

46:00.682 --> 46:03.827
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

46:04.266 --> 46:10.903
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

46:11.300 --> 46:13.338
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

46:13.338 --> 46:15.814
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

46:15.852 --> 46:18.321
♪You're the only one I need♪

46:18.525 --> 46:25.412
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

46:25.724 --> 46:28.995
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

46:29.300 --> 46:32.473
♪My last untouched innocence♪

46:32.797 --> 46:36.223
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

46:36.456 --> 46:39.681
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

46:40.012 --> 46:46.808
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

46:47.177 --> 46:49.239
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

46:49.240 --> 46:51.743
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

46:51.790 --> 46:54.128
♪You're the only one I need♪

46:54.359 --> 47:01.194
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

47:01.543 --> 47:03.161
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

47:03.291 --> 47:05.087
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

47:05.444 --> 47:08.461
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:08.501 --> 47:09.828
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
